OL,3,GNEWSALuke Evans 'selfishly' found
OL,4,Ahimself a leading role in new TV drama
OL,5,
OL,6,FHollywood actor Luke Evans has said he
OL,7,F"selfishly" found himself a leading
OL,8,Frole in a new TV drama, The Party.
OL,10,FThe Pontypool-born actor, who is also
OL,11,Fan executive producer of the five-part
OL,12,Fseries, came up with the idea to adapt
OL,13,Fthe acclaimed novel by Elizabeth Day
OL,14,Finto a drama for the screen.
OL,16,FAfter reading the book, Evans said he
OL,17,Fthought to himself: "This is just so
OL,18,Ffun. It's my kind of story. I love the
OL,19,Fnarrative. I love the characters.
OL,20,FSelfishly, there was also a great
OL,21,Fleading role that I could play."
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
