OL,3,GNEWSALuke Evans 'selfishly' found
OL,4,Ahimself a leading role in new TV drama
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvans will star as Martin Gilmour, a
OL,7,Fjournalist shaped by his lifelong
OL,8,Ffriendship with a wealthy and
OL,9,Fcharismatic politician played by
OL,10,FAberystwyth-born Tom Cullen.
